description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;At Stark, we forge the future of European and national security through cutting-edge, AI-driven technology and unmatched engineering precision. As a premier defence technology company, our mission is clear: to equip NATO Allies and their partners &amp;nbsp;with next-generation autonomous defence platforms and advanced AI-driven software built to perform in the world’s most demanding environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We believe that true security stems from relentless innovation. By combining elite engineering talent with agile technology and an AI-native operational culture, Stark turns complex defence challenges into field-tested, multi-domain solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;WHY JOIN US&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The software and systems you work on directly protect personnel and defend European and national sovereignty.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will work alongside industry-leading minds on autonomous systems, advanced propulsion, and secure cyber platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We foster a fast-paced, collaborative environment where bold ideas are supported by serious R&amp;amp;D backing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will join our C-UAS Edge Software engineering team dedicated to building resilient counter-unmanned aerial system technologies. The team works closely across hardware and software disciplines to deploy real-time software on edge systems. We value rapid iteration, field testing, and collaborative problem-solving to meet critical defence challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a UAV Engineer (Working Student) – C-UAS Edge Software, you will support the design, development, and testing of edge software running on autonomous UAV and counter-UAS platforms. You will collaborate directly with software and hardware&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU WILL DO AT STARK&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and integrate C-UAS software components for edge processing and embedded Linux environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in real-time signal processing, sensor fusion, and telemetry data pipeline implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct software testing in simulation environments and support physical field testing on UAV hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Optimize software algorithms for low-power edge hardware and embedded computing units.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to resolve hardware-software integration issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear technical documentation and automated test suites for software releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING TO THE MISSION&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in a Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Aerospace Engineering, Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, Robotics, or a related technical field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid programming experience in C++ and/or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of Linux operating systems, networking protocols, and embedded system environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with UAV architectures, robotics frameworks (e.g., ROS/ROS2), or drone flight controllers (e.g., PX4, ArduPilot).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English; strong communication and teamwork skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NICE TO HAVE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with hardware-in-the-loop (HIL) testing or field flight testing of unmanned aircraft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with edge AI acceleration hardware (e.g., NVIDIA Jetson, Coral).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of RF technologies, radar systems, or optical sensing for counter-drone applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re interested in building the future of European Defence with us, and you see yourself reflected on the description above, please send us your &lt;strong&gt;CV in English&lt;/strong&gt;. We&#39;re looking forward to meeting you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SECURITY CLEARANCE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Due to the nature of our work in the defence sector, candidates must be eligible to obtain and maintain the appropriate security clearance required for this position. Details will be provided during the recruitment process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EQUAL OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer committed to fostering a diverse and inclusive workplace. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, colour, religion, sex, national origin, disability, or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DATA PRIVACY STATEMENT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;This data privacy statement, which refers exclusively to data collected as part of the online application process, is to inform you about how your personal data that is collected as part of the online application process is handled at our end.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The controller&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The controller under data protection law is:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SKD SE&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Französische Strasse 12, 10117 Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Commercial register entry number: &lt;strong&gt;HRB 260878&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Registration Court: Amtsgericht Charlottenburg&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Protection officer:&lt;/strong&gt; heyData GmbH, Schützenstraße 5, 10117 Berlin,&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.heydata.eu&quot;&gt; www.heydata.eu&lt;/a&gt;, -----
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal data collected as part of the application process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Personal data means any information concerning the personal or material circumstances of an identified or identifiable individual. This includes information such as, for example, your name, address, telephone number and date of birth, but also data relating to your specific career etc. by reference to which a specific individual can be identified with reasonable effort. However, information which cannot be (in)directly associated with your real-life identity is not personal data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fundamentals and purposes of processing personal data collected from application documents and during the application process&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you apply to us electronically, i.e. via e-mail or using our online form, we will collect and process your personal data for the purpose of executing the application process and preparing contracts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting an application via our recruitment website, you express your interest in taking up work with us. In this context, you transmit personal data, which we will use and store exclusively for the purpose of your job search / application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In particular, the following data is collected during this process:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;name (first and last names)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;e-mail address&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;phone number&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;LinkedIn profile (optional)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;channel through which you found us&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Furthermore, you can choose to upload expressive documents such as a cover letter, your CV and reference letters. These may contain additional personal data such as date of birth, address etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Only authorized HR staff and/or staff involved in the application process have access to your data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The personal data is stored, as a rule, exclusively for the purpose of filling the vacancy for which you have applied.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your data will be stored for a period of 180 days after the application process has been concluded. This is usually done to fulfill legal requirements and/or defending ourselves against any claims arising from legal provisions. After this period, we are obligated to delete or anonymize your data. In case of anonymization, the data will only be available to us in the form of so-called metadata, without any direct personal reference, for statistical analysis (for example, share of male and/or female applicants, number of applications per specified period of time etc.).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Furthermore, we reserve the right to store your data for 180 days after the application process has been concluded for the purpose of adding it to our Talent Pool in order to identify any other vacancies that may be of interest to you. This includes, for example, applications for apprenticeships or internships. By accepting the data privacy statement, you consent to any further storage of your data as well as its inclusion in our Talent Pool.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Should you be offered and accept a position with us during the application process, we will store the personal data collected as part of the application process for at least the duration of your employment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclosure of data to third parties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Data transmitted as part of your application will be transferred using TLS encryption and stored in a database. This database is operated by Greenhouse, which offers a human resource and applicant management software solution (https://www.greenhouse.com/data-processing-addendum). In this context, Greenhouse is our processor under article 28 of the GDPR. In this case, the processing is based on an agreement for the processing of orders between us as the controller and Greenhouse.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rights of data subjects&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If we as the controller process personal data, you as the data subject have certain rights under Chapter III of the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), depending on the legal basis and the purpose of the processing, in particular the right of access (article 15 of the GDPR) and the rights to rectification (article 16 of the GDPR), erasure (article 17 of the GDPR), restriction of processing (article 18 of the GDPR), and data portability (article 20 of the GDPR), as well as the right to object (article 21 of the GDPR). If the personal data is processed with your consent, you have the right to withdraw this consent under article 7 III of the GDPR.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To assert your rights as a data subject in relation to the data processed during this online application process, please refer to our Data Protection Officer (see item 2).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concluding provisions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We reserve the right to adjust this data privacy statement at any point in time to ensure that it is in line with the current legal requirements at all times, or in order to accommodate changes in the application process or other processes. In this case, the new data privacy statement applies to any later visit of this recruitment website or any later job application.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;LEGAL NOTICE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;1. Information according to § 5 DDG&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SKD SE&lt;br&gt;Französische Str. 12&lt;br&gt;10117 Berlin&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Internet: &lt;a href=&quot;https://stark-defence.com/en/&quot;&gt;www.stark-defence.com&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;E-Mail: -----
&lt;p&gt;SKD SE, Berlin (registered office of the company), is a Societas Europaea (legal form for joint stock companies), registered at the district court of Berlin (Charlottenburg) under the register number: HRB 260878 B, represented by the Executive Board: Uwe Horstmann, Dr. André Schneider, Johannes Schaback, Jan-Patrick Helmsen, Martin Rost.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chairman of the Supervisory Board is Mr. Robert Maier.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;VAT ID No.: DE369778559&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;2. Liability&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are responsible for the content of our website in accordance with the provisions of general law. All content is created with the necessary care and to the best of our knowledge and is for information purposes only. Insofar as we refer on our Internet pages to the Internet pages of third parties by means of hyperlinks, we cannot accept any liability for guarantee that the linked content is always up to date, correct and complete, as this content is outside our responsibility and we have no influence on its future design. If, in your opinion, content violates applicable law or is inappropriate, please let us know. The legal information on this page as well as all questions and disputes in connection with the design of this website are subject to the law of the Federal Republic of Germany.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;3. Data Protection&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can find our data protection information here. There you will also find the contact details of our data protection officer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;4. Copyright Information&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The texts, images, photos, videos and graphics on our website are generally protected by copyright. Any unauthorized use (in particular the reproduction, editing or distribution) of this copyright-protected content is therefore prohibited. If you intend to use this content or parts thereof, please contact us in advance using the details above. If we are not ourselves the owner of the required copyright usage rights, we will endeavor to arrange contact with the entitled party.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Who we are&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Typeform is a refreshingly different form builder. We help over 150,000 businesses collect the data they need with forms, surveys, and quizzes that people enjoy. Designed to look striking and feel effortless to fill out, Typeform drives 500 million responses every year—and integrates with essential tools like Slack, Zapier, and Hubspot.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3 data-pm-slice=&quot;1 3 []&quot;&gt;About the role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Typeform, we believe technology should make work simpler, smarter and more human.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior IT Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to help shape the future of IT at Typeform. Someone who combines strong technical expertise with a passion for automation, AI and building better ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t just about keeping systems running. It&#39;s about rethinking how IT operates.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll play a key role in building an AI first, service led IT function, improving how we manage internal technology, support our people and automate everyday processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working within a small, high impact team, you&#39;ll have the opportunity to take ownership of meaningful projects, influence our technology roadmap and help us move from reactive support towards smarter, more proactive IT operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own and improve our IT operations&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a senior escalation point for complex IT incidents, requests and technical challenges, taking ownership through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain secure, reliable and scalable internal technology systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply ITIL best practices across incident, change, problem and service management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve service performance, documentation, operational processes and the overall employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with the wider IT team to balance daily support with longer term engineering projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build smarter systems through AI and automation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to automate repetitive tasks and improve workflows across IT.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement AI powered solutions that improve service delivery, productivity and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve employee onboarding, offboarding, access management and software lifecycle processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use APIs, integrations, scripting and automation tools to connect systems and remove unnecessary manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore emerging AI technologies and turn promising ideas into practical solutions, with appropriate security and governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Think like a product owner&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of specific IT services and capabilities, from identifying problems through to delivering improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with stakeholders to understand their needs and prioritise improvements based on business impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain clear roadmaps and project backlogs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Measure the success of improvements through service quality, efficiency, reliability and employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead technical changes, migrations and improvements with clear communication, risk management and planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across Typeform&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, People, Finance, Procurement and Engineering to deliver secure and effective technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate technical concepts clearly to both technical and nontechnical colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge, improve documentation and support the development of other IT team members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help create a culture of ownership, continuous improvement and experimentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What you&#39;ll bring&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience in corporate IT engineering, systems engineering or IT service management within a modern SaaS or technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ITIL certification and practical experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;applying ITIL principles across incident, change, problem and service management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience troubleshooting complex issues across corporate IT systems, identity, access, devices, applications and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands on experience with modern IT environments, particularly Apple devices, Okta, Google Workspace, Slack and Atlassian.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building automation using APIs, scripting, integrations or workflow automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical experience using AI to improve IT operations, support processes or internal productivity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience improving employee lifecycle processes, including onboarding, offboarding, provisioning and access management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem solving skills and the ability to take ownership of technical challenges from investigation through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A product mindset, with experience prioritising improvements, managing stakeholders and delivering measurable outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and the ability to work effectively across technical and business teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing AI driven IT workflows or introducing AI into internal service operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with AI agents, intelligent workflow orchestration and knowledge management systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating HR, identity, finance, asset management and IT service platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building internal tooling, dashboards or operational reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to security, compliance, endpoint management and IT governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading technology migrations or large internal systems improvement projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Typeform drives hundreds of millions of interactions each year, enabling conversational, human-centered experiences across the globe. We &lt;strong&gt;move as one team&lt;/strong&gt;, empowering our collective efforts by valuing each individual’s unique perspective. This fosters &lt;strong&gt;strong bonds&lt;/strong&gt; grounded in respect, transparency, and trust. We &lt;strong&gt;champion our diverse customer base&lt;/strong&gt; by anticipating their needs and addressing their challenges with priority. Committed to excellence, we&lt;strong&gt; hold high expectations &lt;/strong&gt;for ourselves and each other, continuously striving to deliver exceptional results.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are proud to be an equal-opportunity employer. We celebrate diversity and stand firmly against discrimination and harassment of any kind—whether based on race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity or expression, or veteran status. Everyone is welcome here.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will develop software for system and regression testing of our robots, including test scripts, test tools, and automation solutions. Your core output will be high-quality, reusable test software that helps the team improve the efficiency, coverage, and repeatability of robot system testing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a development engineer role. You will collaborate with the robotics test and system test engineers in the team to develop scripts, tools, and automation solutions for key software and hardware test scenarios across our robot systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to software development, you will have the opportunity to participate directly in validation and debugging work on physical robots and in simulation environments. You will run and refine the tools and automated test solutions you develop on real systems, gaining first-hand insight into how robots behave and the challenges they face in real-world environments.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop system, integration, and regression test scripts in Python or C++ for various robotic platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop ROS 2-based test tools, such as nodes for stimulating and monitoring the system, tools for data recording and replay, log and rosbag analysis, and test result reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Debug, validate, run, and maintain automated test solutions in simulation environments and on physical robots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop scripts and tools for long-duration stability, performance, and fault-injection testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with system test engineers in the team to turn manual test scenarios suitable for automation into stable, reusable test scripts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate test scripts into CI/CD pipelines so that they run automatically with each build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain test code quality through code reviews, documentation, and version control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use the tools you develop to support issue reproduction, diagnosis, and analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;What You Bring&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on ROS 2 development experience gained through work, internships, a thesis, or student projects; able to write nodes using rclpy or rclcpp, with familiarity in topics, services, actions, parameters, launch files, and rosbag&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A robotics background, with practical experience in robot development or testing through work, internships, a working student role, a thesis, or student projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong programming skills in at least one of Python or C++&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Bachelor’s degree or higher in Robotics, Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, Mechatronics, or a related field; recent graduates are welcome&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Linux and Git&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A long-term interest in robot testing and quality engineering, as well as an interest in debugging and validating your own code on real robots&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good written and spoken English skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with robot arms, legged robots, or other mobile robot platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience developing automated tests for real hardware&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with simulation tools such as Gazebo, Isaac Sim, or MuJoCo&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with CI/CD pipelines, such as GitLab CI, GitHub Actions, or Jenkins&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Docker and test environment management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with HIL or SIL test setups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 class=&quot;TranslationField-module__fieldItemName___Q0F_7 TranslationField-module__aboutUsWrapper___WXJpq&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;A dynamic high-tech company, combined with financial soundness and world-class investors.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Join an interdisciplinary, international team with 60+ different nationalities in a collaborative work environment.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Lots of development opportunities as we continue to grow.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Challenging tasks and impactful projects alongside experts that enable professional and personal growth.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Corporate Benefits Program covering health, mobility, and learning for 100€ net per month.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Modern office facilities with a rooftop terrace overlooking Munich, free drinks &amp;amp; fruits, and regular company events contribute to a good working environment&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agile Robots&lt;/strong&gt; is a leading provider of AI-powered robotics solutions. By combining artificial intelligence and robotics, the company makes industries smarter, more flexible, and more efficient.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in Munich in 2018 by renowned robotics researchers from the German Aerospace Center (DLR), Agile Robots has experienced rapid global growth. Today, more than 3,500 highly skilled robotics and AI enthusiasts are employed worldwide. The company has one of the largest research and development teams in the AI and robotics industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agile Robots has built a unique portfolio, together with the subsidiaries BÄR Automation, Franka Robotics, idealworks, and Krause Automation, the company covers all areas of AI-driven robotics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more at: &lt;a id=&quot;menur58p&quot; class=&quot;fui-Link ___1q1shib f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl fyind8e f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv fk6fouc fjoy568 figsok6 f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f1cmlufx f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1deo86v f1eh06m1 f1iescvh fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f1h8hb77 f1lqvz6u f10aw75t fsle3fq f17ae5zn&quot; href=&quot;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.agile-robots.com/en/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

